  "description": "Asks at which public call a row-dependent failure appears: OpenRecordset, the first field read, MoveNext onto the failing row, or the Value read. SELECT Id, 1/[Denominator] over Den (2, 0, Null) as snapshot, dynaset and forward-only; zero-row queries whose projection would fail; and a snapshot whose failing CInt([TextValue]) column is never read while Id is traversed, then MoveLast and RecordCount. Fixture r-expr-1-main2 is opened read-only through DAO.DBEngine.120; engine version and loaded modules are recorded; each recordset reads Name, Type and Value of every field.",
